  "limitations": [
    "Single complete sweep on one WSL2 host; frequency, thermal state and host scheduling uncontrolled.",
    "The encoder and decoder sweeps ran concurrently on logical CPUs 2 and 6 (separate physical cores sharing the L3 cache); nothing else ran.",
    "C then mzstd run consecutively per case in a fixed order inside one Criterion process. Individual mean confidence intervals do not account for all host variation or multiple comparisons.",
    "Every corpus/level pair has equal weight, including empty and tiny input; the median describes this corpus, not a production workload.",
    "Cold APIs include allocation and the allocator state the process has reached, including glibc's dynamic mmap and trim thresholds.",
    "The C library is built by zstd-ffi with cc defaults and without its Huffman assembly decoder.",
    "Earlier published sweeps used different sampling durations and source trees; differences between them are not controlled before/after speedups."
  ],
